        ],
        "text": "According to United States, the case centers on the definition of conspiracy as an agreement to commit an unlawful act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice O'Connor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6158348c51376ab74d1db5c527db75dc1f6fae458381a8602802fefed89b5057",
