            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice O'Connor asked whether an act in furtherance of the conspiracy is required."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice O'Connor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6158348c51376ab74d1db5c527db75dc1f6fae458381a8602802fefed89b5057",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6158348c5137-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice O'Connor also asked when a conspiracy terminates."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "6158348c51376ab74d1db5c527db75dc1f6fae458381a8602802fefed89b5057",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-6158348c5137-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 9,
              "start": 9
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, justice Stevens questioned the difference between an attempt and a conspiracy, noting that an attempt requires a dangerous probability of success while a conspiracy does not."
      }
